<title>DENMARK: FORECAST-Denmark upgrades 97/98 growth forecasts.</title>
<headline>FORECAST-Denmark upgrades 97/98 growth forecasts.</headline>
<dateline>COPENHAGEN 1997-05-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Denmark's economy ministry said in its latest economic survey issued on Tuesday that it expected 3.3 percent growth in Gross Domestic Product (GDP) in 1997 and 3.0 percent in 1998.</p>
<p>In its previous report last December, the ministry predicted 1997 GDP growth of 2.9 percent and 2.7 percent in 1998.</p>
<p>Danish GDP rose 2.4 percent in 1996. --Steve Weizman, Copenhagen newsroom +45-33969652</p>
</text>
